      "dcDescription": [
        "1933.01.0235 Stig Rydén Sombrero Negro, Prov.Formosa, Argentina. Sombrero Negro, prov. Formosa, Argentina skiss Toba plexiring Expedition till Sydamerika (1932) Argentina Qom Toba Water jug from Argentina. On the border with Brazil is one of South America’s biggest tourist attractions, Iguazú Falls. These waterfalls are listed as a UNESCO World Heritage Site. The steady flow of visitors wanting to see the waters contributes to economic growth but also places strain on local resources. Vattenkrus.Gåva. Korsvägar 1 - (plan 4) Korsvägar 1 - Zon A2 Korsvägar 1, Zon A2-1 Vattenkrus från Argentina. "
